Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another Soul Transformation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,as I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:29.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,My spiritual energy is in chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,and my Origin Soul is damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even when using the celestial sword
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not as strong as when I fought Red Butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:40.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Heaven-Sealing Formation is extremely complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,it must be some kind of ancient inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't escape it in a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:52.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, run !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,This truly is a fine sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,It even contains a Sword Spirit !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword can be yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the flag that can summon tribulations
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I am taking back the star compass
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,that belonged to my clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:37.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Giant Demon Clan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.65,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1604,475)\fad(300,000)}Giant Demon Clan Ancestor\NEarly stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man is indeed from the Giant Demon Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back in the Celestial Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you stole the star compass from our young master, Chi Hu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:57.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,But today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:03:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take it back !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two Soul Transformation old monsters joining hands
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,just to take my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:09.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be sure to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should remember it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will leave your artifacts behind !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a good artifact !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:43.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm out of spiritual energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,please let this Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill this person
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,to avenge myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chi Hu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,accept your death !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spiritual energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,escape to the southeast !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go, now !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the star compass is something I gifted to Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:50.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,not something he stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu saved my life many times in the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Chi Hu, am a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:56.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I abandon him just like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Step aside !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:02.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The star compass is useless to our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what if I give it to Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You took his flying sword, isn’t that enough ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you weren’t the junior with the purest Giant Demon blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would kill you today, you ungrateful brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once we return,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be punished to 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,of constant pain from body refinement !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Chi Hu, am an honorable man
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I can’t do something so heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,tried my best...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is mysterious,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's even able to prevent me from entering
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the southeast
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's a forest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,rich in Yin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:48.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I can escape the formation there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can flee into a spatial rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,before a Soul Transformation cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,a mere Soul Formation cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:01.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1554,469)\fad(300,000)}Li Yuanfeng's\NTea Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Transformation domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is my Tea Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fragrance of tea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,allows me to savor the flavors of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pot hides a universe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:19.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the leaves represent Spring and Autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.20,Second,,0,0,0,,Life and Death Domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:20.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,With tea as my companion
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I grasped the meaning of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before the domain of a Soul Transformation cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,your domain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We’ve wasted enough time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:05.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,after killing him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have other matters to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:08.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you refuse to act,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,does that mean you are afraid of Mount Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,since I initiated this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll take care of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's here at last...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:38.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven-Sealing Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:43.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I didn’t already know this formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would’ve been really hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,for me to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:48.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Corpse Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although they’re only Early stage Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,it’s said that Giant Demons who reach Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,awaken their bloodline's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer not to provoke them too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:05.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you have nothing better to do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,than getting yourself into trouble ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You two old fossils,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't you ashamed of bullying a Soul Formation junior ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:19.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m taking this person away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere Early stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,whose cultivation was forcibly raised
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:31.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,of speaking to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:37.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,he must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And his corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,belongs to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’re not from the Corpse Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,what use do you have for a corpse ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:53.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:56.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,But a strand of his soul fled to the Foreign Battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:09:59.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I pursued it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,but after decades of searching,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:04.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fear that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Defying Bead is also...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,aware of this matter ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course not,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ve erased all witnesses’ memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only I and the Envoy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,sent to Zhao's Heaven's Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,very good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:38.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,A treasure wanted by even the Cultivation Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,can’t just disappear like that !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:47.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we offer the Heaven Defying Bead to the Cultivation Alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:51.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will be promoted to a rank 6 cultivation country
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,and gifted our own cultivation planet !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:55.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,When that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:59.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Giant Demon Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have the ability to have Ascendant level cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I searched for Wang Lin’s whereabouts for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only after Chi Hu returned from the Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,did I learn by coincidence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,that Ceng Niu was Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:25.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,To prevent the country of Suzaku from interfering,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I waited for the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,When Li Yuanfeng came to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:33.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used the star compass as an excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,to join him to kill Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:39.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if Wang Lin dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as I have his corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can get my hand on the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have my own reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.69,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1608,428)\fad(300,000)}Giant Axe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:15.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1600,464)\fad(300,300)}Border of the\Ncountry of Pilu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Tai came to save me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't have good intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:25.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, it was the only way to escape the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:27.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,A thousand-year slave seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's only been a few years and you caused such a disaster !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:34.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time, I’ll seal you completely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:37.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you won’t drag me down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm afraid to fight you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:13.39,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1452,467)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\N3rd layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did this happen ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuanfeng’s Tea Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Sun Tai’s sealing mark
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,must have combined into a powerful restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.35,0:13:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's draining my spiritual energy completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll revert into a powerless mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last time I was this badly injured
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:36.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,was when Teng Huayuan destroyed my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that centuries later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:43.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would encounter such a disaster again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ve been cautious every step of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but still ended up at the mercy of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,is mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:26.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,When Soul Transformation cultivators fight for real,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,it’s a battle of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you ready ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:36.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fighting a Middle stage Soul Transformation is exhausting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,but Wang Lin is crucial to the Giant Demon Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:41.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that it’s come to this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’ve forced my hand !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:02.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Transformation cultivators rarely fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once our celestial spiritual energy is depleted,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,it cannot be replenished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,But since you insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man will face you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,with celestial spiritual energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.45,0:15:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The might of celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,is exclusive to Soul Transformation and above.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will never let the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to revive my clan slip away !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:39.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man is Middle stage Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with your Giant Demon Clan’s bloodline,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,you cannot bridge the gap between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still refusing to yield ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:50.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lightning Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,was gained after I paid a great price
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cultivate a century on the Heavenly Thunder Planet !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:56.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1650,461)\fad(300,000)}Sun Tai's\NThunder Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mere Early stage Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,will die now !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll take this person away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and return him in 7 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:17.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I let you take him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's the same as giving you my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to sneak up on him under my nose !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The seal on this kid is only half-complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must finish off these two quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:47.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,or else
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,something might go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:52.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since reaching Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:57.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is my first time using my bloodline's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:16:59.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,take my attack !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turn !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Child,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:10.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1601,465)\fad(300,000)}Demon Child\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:17.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turn !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:18.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Child,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:23.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turn !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my Early stage Soul Transformation cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,my bloodline's power has no attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can only teleport the target to a distant planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I keep fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my soul will dissipate...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I played all my cards
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:36.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they didn't amount to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was all in vain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation is still falling...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,My spiritual energy is leaving my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:49.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The path of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,truly is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 8 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan’er will face the law of the heavens again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,8 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:31.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:42.56,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:42.56,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:50.16,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:50.16,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:57.72,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:57.72,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:01.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.04,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:04.76,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:04.76,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:08.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:12.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:16.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:20.32,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.32,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:25.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:28.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:31.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:35.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:39.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:44.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:49.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:53.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:58.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.28,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:01.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:06.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.25,0:21:09.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:14.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:18.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:21.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:24.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:28.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:33.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
